# Cargo build artifacts
/target/
debug/
**/*.rs.bk
*.pdb

# Cargo mutants
**/mutants.out*/

# Database files
*.db
*.db-shm
*.db-wal

# macOS
.DS_Store

# IDEs & editors
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
*.swo
*~

# Claude Code local state
.claude/settings.local.json
.claude/worktrees/

# Package tarballs dropped outside target/ (helm package, cargo package)
*.tgz
*.crate

# TLS material. Deliberately unconditional: a test fixture that needs a key
# generates it in-process (rcgen) rather than earning an exception here. An
# exception is how the JWT test keys came to exist on one disk and in no
# checkout, which passed locally and broke every test target in CI.
*.pem
*.key

# Environment & local config
.env
.env.*
/config.toml

# mdBook rendered output
/docs/book/

# Wrangler local dev state (`just docs-preview`)
/docs/.wrangler/

# The pinned mdBook binary docs/build.sh fetches when one is not on PATH
# (Cloudflare's build image); dev machines and CI never populate this.
/docs/.bin/

# Benchmark results: scratch runs stay local; each Orion release record
# (RELEASING.md's C13 session) gets an explicit re-include line. Deliberately
# not a blanket `v*` — dev machines hold comparison dirs named after
# dataflow-rs versions (v2.1.5, v3.0.x) that must stay local.
/crates/orion-server/tests/benchmark/results/*
!/crates/orion-server/tests/benchmark/results/v0.2.0/
!/crates/orion-server/tests/benchmark/results/v1.0.0/

# Launch/marketing collateral (local only — drafts, checklists, submission notes)
/marketing/

# Internal working documents (audit backlogs, design proposals)
/proposals/
